      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Intervals greedy</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/non-overlapping-intervals/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 435</a></div>\n  <h1>Non-overlapping Intervals</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: removing the fewest is keeping the most, and the most are kept by always taking the interval that ends first. Sort by end, keep what starts at or after the last kept end, answer n - kept. O(n log n) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
